    "notes": "Boustrophedon scan of the LEFT rack in the Isaac DPV aisle, modelled on the real M0001_KZ01 pattern (move_to_point_B -> ascend -> move_to_point_A -> ascend, one traverse per shelf level). Yaw is held at 30 deg throughout, so there are no type-2 turn waypoints. Frame: mission +x is EAST (Isaac +X) and the origin is the vehicle spawn at Isaac (-9, 0) - the stack works in the ENU fcu_odom_flu frame, NOT PX4 NED. Yaw is ENU too (0 = +x/East, CCW positive), so 30 deg points the nose/ZED 30 deg toward +y, i.e. at the left rack; the scan therefore stands off at y=+0.6, 1.02 m from that rack's face at y=+1.6175. Traverse heights are the stock Isaac rack's measured shelf decks (1.33, 2.83, 4.13; frame top 6.00). Scanned span x=1..16 sits well inside the 35.24 m hall, which runs x=-8.62..26.62 in this frame."
  },
